---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Landscaping & Turf Services in Central Texas"
description: "Landscape design, installation, hardscape, pergolas, lawn care, tree trimming & irrigation across Buda, Kyle, San Marcos & Central Texas. Free estimates from a family-owned crew."
---
{% import "partials/icons.njk" as ico %}
{% import "partials/photo.njk" as photo %}

<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <p class="hero__tagline">Our Services</p>
      <h1>Complete lawn &amp; landscaping services in Central Texas</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">Lawn care, misting systems, outdoor living, sprinkler systems and tree care — everything your yard needs, from one trusted local crew.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact/">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        <a class="btn btn--white btn--lg" href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ ico.svg("phone") }} {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="wrap crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Services</nav>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for c in serviceCategories %}
      <a class="card card--link" href="/services/{{ c.slug }}/">
        <div class="card__photo">{{ photo.service(c.subs[0], c.name) }}</div>
        <div class="card__body">
          <div class="card__icon">{{ ico.svg(c.icon) }}</div>
          <h3>{{ c.name }}</h3>
          <p class="muted">{{ c.short }}</p>
          <span class="card__more">
            {% if c.subs.length > 1 %}{{ c.subs.length }} services{% else %}Learn more{% endif %} {{ ico.svg("arrow") }}
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Design → Build → Maintain</p>
      <h2>Why one crew for all of it matters</h2>
      <p>When the people who design your landscape are also the ones who build and maintain it, nothing gets lost in translation. We plant what we know we can keep alive, build what we know we can service, and stand behind all of it with a workmanship warranty.</p>
      <ul class="checks mt-2">
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>Free, on-site consultation with the owner</span></li>
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>Residential &amp; light commercial properties welcome</span></li>
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>Native &amp; water-wise recommendations for Hays County</span></li>
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>Licensed, insured &amp; warranty-backed work</span></li>
        <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>10% off for military, first responders, nurses &amp; teachers</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="brandbar brandbar--pest"></div>
        <h3>Need pest or termite service too?</h3>
        <p class="muted">Many of our customers use both of our family companies. For pest control, termite letters for home closings, rodent exclusion and lawn-pest treatment, our sister company has you covered.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--navy" href="{{ site.sister.url }}" rel="noopener">Visit Excel Pest &amp; Lawn Control {{ ico.svg("arrow") }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
